   485	        assert breaker[0].zone_lo == pytest.approx(98.2)
\n=== composition reading notes ===
CP-12 Toobit source `_walk_backward` applies `_ohlc_violation` before collected rows are returned to the bootstrap runner; then `_ingest` routes only those accepted MarketObservation rows to ingest_observations/store.
SQLiteStore CH4_DDL applies the same OHLC envelope CHECK to market_observation; CP-12 is the earlier observable drop gate.
EngineContextProducer.window reads CLOSED/CORRECTED store observations and joins raw lineage; complete_engine_bundle maps canonical observation fields to E05 bars and invokes E06 with the aligned mature E03/E04 evidence suffix.
run_apex serve constructs BootstrapService, EngineContextProducer, PaperPlanBridge, and PaperRuntime. PaperRuntime catches up via its injected catch_up; later stages use the plan provider and do not construct the CP-3 unit-test bar dicts.
E05/E06 unit tests call frozen run_engine/detect functions with raw dict/list fixtures, bypassing the source and store boundaries by design. That supports formula tests, not end-to-end valid-market-input proof.
